{% comment %}
  Called by the theme's bib layout just before it builds the venue line of a paper.
  The year is left out when it would only repeat information:
  - papers under review (pubgroup = {underreview} in papers.bib) show the venue alone, e.g.
    "Under review at ICASSP 2027" instead of "Under review at ICASSP 2027, 2026";
  - when the venue already names the year, e.g. "NeurIPS 2023 Main Hall Poster, ...", it is not
    repeated at the end.
  Once a paper is accepted and its pubgroup is changed to {reviewed}, the year shows again.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign venue_text = entrytype | strip_html %}
{% assign year_text = entry.year | append: "" %}
{% if entry.pubgroup == 'underreview' or venue_text contains year_text %}
  {% assign entryyear = '' %}
  {% assign entrymonth = '' %}
{% endif %}
